---
const hooks = [
  {
    title: "Packet-level network troubleshooting",
    detail: "Wireshark, SMTP/DNS/HTTP",
  },
  {
    title: "Log-driven root-cause analysis",
    detail: "Splunk + SPL, the CloudWatch skillset",
  },
  {
    title: "Linux & web-server administration",
    detail: "Ubuntu, nginx, Bash, auditd",
  },
];
---

<section id="evidence" class="evidence">
  <h2>Evidence</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="block">
      <h3>Technical</h3>
      <ul>
        {
          hooks.map((h) => (
            <li>
              <span class="hook-title">{h.title}</span>
              <span class="hook-detail">{h.detail}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <a href="/resume" class="more">Full breakdown on résumé →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <h3>Leadership</h3>
      <p>
        Co-founder and president of <strong>KurultAI</strong>, a Kyrgyz tech
        community club I helped start at LWTech. Most recently: 1st place,
        Polymarket track, QuackHacks 2.0.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <h3>Customer-facing</h3>
      <p>
        Three years at my family's clothing stall in Dordoi Bazaar, Bishkek —
        reading what a customer actually needed, across a language barrier,
        with no script to fall back on.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .evidence {
    padding-block: 2rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.55;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .block {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--color-panel);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem;
  }

  h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-route);
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .hook-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .hook-detail {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .block p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .more {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-route);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .more:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
